WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:06.376
The Ace to Five of Swords run from clear
thinking into strain, rest and conflict.

00:00:06.376 --> 00:00:09.443
Each card has an upright and a reversed
meaning.

00:00:10.743 --> 00:00:11.499
Ace of Swords.

00:00:11.499 --> 00:00:13.819
Clarity, truth, a breakthrough in
thinking.

00:00:13.819 --> 00:00:17.813
A hand from a cloud holds an upright sword
topped with a crown and wreath.

00:00:19.113 --> 00:00:19.984
Two of Swords.

00:00:19.984 --> 00:00:22.411
Stalemate, difficult choice, avoidance.

00:00:22.411 --> 00:00:27.948
A blindfolded figure sits with two swords crossed
over the chest, in front of a calm sea.

00:00:29.248 --> 00:00:30.181
Three of Swords.

00:00:30.181 --> 00:00:31.988
Heartache, sorrow, honest pain.

00:00:31.988 --> 00:00:34.786
Three swords pierce a heart against a
rainy sky.

00:00:36.186 --> 00:00:38.541
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:38.541 --> 00:00:43.315
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
